### CareNest Water Log API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### ============================================================
### Variables - Update these with actual IDs from your database
### ============================================================
@base_url = http://localhost:8000
@user_id = MbG3wwDSH1o5lqQYoFG1
@log_id = REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_LOG_ID

### ============================================================
### 1. Log Water Intake - Morning Glass
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 250,
  "note": "Morning water after waking up"
}

### ============================================================
### 2. Log Water Intake - With Meal
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 300,
  "note": "With lunch"
}

### ============================================================
### 3. Log Water Intake - Minimal (No Note)
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 500
}

### ============================================================
### 4. Log Water Intake - Exercise Hydration
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 750,
  "note": "Post workout hydration"
}

### ============================================================
### 5. Log Water Intake - Small Sip
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 100,
  "note": "Small sip - medicine"
}

### ============================================================
### 6. Get All Water Logs for User (Default: 50, ordered by created_at desc)
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}

### ============================================================
### 7. Get All Water Logs with Pagination
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}?limit=10&order_by=created_at&descending=true

### ============================================================
### 8. Get Single Water Log by ID
### (Replace log_id with actual ID from create response)
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/{{log_id}}

### ============================================================
### 9. Get Water Logs by Date Range
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/range?start_date=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&end_date=2026-01-31T23:59:59Z

### ============================================================
### 10. Update Water Log - Update Amount Only
### ============================================================
PATCH {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/{{log_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 350
}

### ============================================================
### 11. Update Water Log - Update Note Only
### ============================================================
PATCH {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/{{log_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Updated - Morning glass with lemon"
}

### ============================================================
### 12. Update Water Log - Update Both Fields
### ============================================================
PATCH {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/{{log_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 400,
  "note": "Large glass with breakfast"
}

### ============================================================
### 13. Get Daily Water Intake Summary (Default Goal: 2500ml)
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/summary/{{user_id}}/daily?date=2026-01-11T00:00:00Z

### ============================================================
### 14. Get Daily Water Summary with Custom Goal
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/summary/{{user_id}}/daily?date=2026-01-11T00:00:00Z&goal_ml=3000

### ============================================================
### 15. Get Water Log Count
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/stats/{{user_id}}/count

### ============================================================
### 16. Delete Single Water Log
### ============================================================
DELETE {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/{{log_id}}

### ============================================================
### 17. Delete All Water Logs (Use with caution!)
### ============================================================
DELETE {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}

### ============================================================
### ERROR TESTS
### ============================================================

### 18. Get Non-existent Water Log (404 Test)
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/non_existent_log_id

### 19. Create Water Log - Invalid Data (Missing required field)
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Missing amount_ml field"
}

### 20. Create Water Log - Invalid Amount (Must be > 0)
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 0,
  "note": "Zero amount - should fail"
}

### 21. Create Water Log - Negative Amount
### ============================================================
POST {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": -100,
  "note": "Negative amount - should fail"
}

### 22. Date Range - Invalid Range (start > end)
### ============================================================
GET {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/range?start_date=2026-12-31T00:00:00Z&end_date=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z

### 23. Update Non-existent Log (404 Test)
### ============================================================
PATCH {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/non_existent_log_id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_ml": 500
}

### 24. Delete Non-existent Log (404 Test)
### ============================================================
DELETE {{base_url}}/nutrition/water/{{user_id}}/non_existent_log_id
